{"title":"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a00d9600453b5f79a8ea20606ca8f0a538bac5e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> is a chord of a circle such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93177aa484f3d901b77587ad2ed451dbb9d96b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE=3$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b17d5e2d30e661c3842fafc639169ce5a337aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EB=5 .$\" width=\"66\" height=\"12\" /> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the center of the circle. Join <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db9d3474e139c8e1c2f5902c3cb42d7e47fa7e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OE$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> and extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db9d3474e139c8e1c2f5902c3cb42d7e47fa7e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OE$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> to cut the circle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/792daa030c96693198f143f9176bf888b7ca25cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C.$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> Given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f71def7050217958196ff7bc5d787ab543ff3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC=1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> find the radius of the circle.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:CanadianMO_1971-1.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/5/56/CanadianMO_1971-1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"174\" height=\"185\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9dc4f9abdac55c081c747fd2db62ae369497f05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CO$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> to meet the circle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3ce33ec2a34dc4fddaec3224043f4a72bbe6d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> Let the radius be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/279a83610a37e3f83bb8d2544695241ca8066834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> Applying <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power_of_a_point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power of a point\">power of a point</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e6749a46f80da083c53cc6cfd2e44fc8455dde0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(EP)(CE)=(BE)(ED)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f40296fecc80535f6263e23789b2be7dbd1a97c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r-1=15.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" /> Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/2/032e96791b617e6a850e400cf2c11bbc69e3a51e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=8.$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO\">1971 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017170716\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 108/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 986/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 68/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2244/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.633      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box\n100.00%    6.633      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3574:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017170716 and revision id 226472. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}